        'citations': 
        a list of citations, each citation is also a json string. 
        - think of at least 3 authorities from the following perspectives: (1) Highest controlling case first (SCOTUS, Fed. Cir., governing circuit, or state high court). 
        (2) Relevant Supreme Court case if not already in the first.  (3) Optional persuasive authority
